1. Respond with ONLY the JSON structure below - no other text.
2. Fill ALL SIX score categories: parseability, keywords, actionVerbs, contactInfo, sectionCompleteness, experienceSignals - each with score, max, and non-empty evidence.
3. keyStrengths: 1–5 items. areasForImprovement: 1–3 items, focused on screenability. reasoning: short narrative.

